Source adaptations: explicit PM1/MDS2/PM2/NMDS mathematics from Pastis, and observation-only ICE normalization from iced. Copyright and license texts follow verbatim. The cleaned implementation removes domain-library dependencies; auxiliary NMDS includes an explicitly documented ndarray/string API guard repair.

DATA RIGHTS: The real Duan yeast contact matrix and genomic bins are an author-distributed scientific example. A separate per-file redistribution license has not been identified. The software licenses below cover code and are not asserted to license experimental data. This package is prepared for authorized local research and benchmark review; public data redistribution remains a release limitation. No claim is made that reconstructed coordinates are measured truth.

